id=bt_hires_mixer
name=BT Hi-Res Mixer (NX809J)
version=v0.6.1
versionCode=8
author=XPRAMT
description=Hi-res mixer for NX809J: per-rate deep-buffer mix ports for Bluetooth A2DP and wired headphones plus a one-instruction audio policy patch so 44.1/48 kHz tracks pick the output with their own rate. Also rounds the HAL deep-buffer size up to 16 frames (no 44.1/88.2 kHz crackle). The patched libraries are built on the phone at install time from its own files.
